<!doctype html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>BIST Strateji ve Hisse Raporu - {{ as_of_date }}</title>
<style>
  /* ========== BASE RESET & INSTITUTIONAL TYPOGRAPHY ========== */
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    background-color: #f1f5f9;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
    color: #1e293b;
    line-height: 1.55;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    padding: 24px 12px;
  }
  .wrap {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* ========== CARDS & CONTAINERS ========== */
  .card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 24px 26px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
  }
  .card-flush {
    padding: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* ========== EXECUTIVE HEADER ========== */
  .header-card {
    background: #0f172a;
    color: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 28px 30px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.18);
  }
  .header-meta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: #94a3b8;
  }
  .header-title {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }
  .header-subtitle {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .macro-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(130px, 1fr));
    gap: 8px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
  }
  .macro-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .macro-lbl {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #94a3b8;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .macro-val {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .macro-pill-alert {
    display: inline-block;
    background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.25);
    color: #fca5a5;
    border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  /* ========== SECTION TITLES ========== */
  .section-header {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #0f172a;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .section-title::before {
    content: "";
    display: inline-block;
    width: 4px;
    height: 16px;
    background: #2563eb;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  .section-desc {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #64748b;
    margin-top: 3px;
    padding-left: 12px;
  }

  /* ========== STATUS BADGES ========== */
  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 2px 7px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 9.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    white-space: nowrap;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }
  .badge-STRONG_OPPORTUNITY { background: #dcfce7; color: #15803d; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; }
  .badge-OPPORTUNITY        { background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; border: 1px solid #bae6fd; }
  .badge-WATCHLIST          { background: #fef3c7; color: #b45309; border: 1px solid #fde68a; }
  .badge-NO_ACTION          { background: #f1f5f9; color: #64748b; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
  .badge-QUARANTINE         { background: #fee2e2; color: #b91c1c; border: 1px solid #fecaca; }

  /* ========== TABLES ========== */
  .table-responsive {
    overflow-x: auto;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #ffffff;
  }
  .table-exec {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .table-exec th {
    background: #f8fafc;
    color: #475569;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .table-exec td {
    padding: 11px 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
    color: #1e293b;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }
  .table-exec tr:last-child td {
    border-bottom: none;
  }
  .table-exec tr:hover td {
    background: #f8fafc;
  }

  .col-ticker-wrap {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .col-ticker {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #0f172a;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }
  .col-num {
    text-align: right;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .col-roi {
    text-align: right;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #059669;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .col-stop {
    text-align: right;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #dc2626;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .col-range {
    text-align: right;
    color: #475569;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .col-sub {
    display: block;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-top: 1px;
  }

  /* ========== QUICK COPY CONTAINER ========== */
  .quick-copy-wrapper {
    margin-top: 14px;
  }
  .quick-copy-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .quick-copy-title {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: #64748b;
  }
  .quick-copy-box {
    background: #0f172a;
    color: #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    overflow-x: auto;
    border: 1px solid #1e293b;
  }

  /* ========== CANDIDATE DOSSIER CARD ========== */
  .dossier-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-top: 14px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .dossier-header {
    background: #f8fafc;
    padding: 12px 18px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .dossier-header-left {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .dossier-ticker {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #0f172a;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .dossier-peer {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #64748b;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .dossier-strip {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #334155;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .dossier-strip-item {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .dossier-strip-item b {
    color: #0f172a;
  }

  .dossier-body {
    padding: 16px 18px;
  }
  .dossier-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .dossier-callout-thesis {
    background: #f8fafc;
    border-left: 3px solid #2563eb;
    border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: #334155;
  }
  .dossier-callout-thesis b {
    color: #0f172a;
  }
  .dossier-callout-thesis ul {
    margin-top: 6px;
    padding-left: 16px;
    color: #475569;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .dossier-callout-thesis li {
    margin-bottom: 3px;
  }

  .dossier-callout-risk {
    background: #fffbeb;
    border-left: 3px solid #f59e0b;
    border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: #78350f;
  }
  .dossier-callout-risk b {
    color: #451a03;
  }
  .dossier-invalidation {
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: #92400e;
    background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12);
    padding: 4px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  /* Key Metrics Micro-Table */
  .metrics-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
    gap: 6px 16px;
    background: #f8fafc;
    border: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .metric-entry {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;
    padding: 4px 0;
  }
  .metric-entry:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }
  .metric-key {
    color: #64748b;
  }
  .metric-val {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #0f172a;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .dossier-note {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #64748b;
    margin-top: 10px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .dossier-note b {
    color: #334155;
  }

  /* Reference Models Box */
  .ref-box {
    background: #f8fafc;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #64748b;
    margin-top: 10px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .ref-box b {
    color: #1e293b;
  }

  /* Warning Box */
  .warn-card {
    background: #fffbeb;
    border-left: 3px solid #f59e0b;
    border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #92400e;
  }
  .warn-card b {
    color: #78350f;
  }
  .warn-card ul {
    margin: 4px 0 0;
    padding-left: 16px;
  }

  /* Invalidation Triggered Box */
  .alert-card {
    background: #fef2f2;
    border-left: 3px solid #ef4444;
    border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: #991b1b;
  }
  .alert-card b {
    color: #7f1d1d;
  }
  .alert-card ul {
    margin: 6px 0 0;
    padding-left: 18px;
  }

  /* Evaluation & Diff Sections */
  .eval-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 12px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .eval-table th {
    background: #f8fafc;
    color: #64748b;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .eval-table td {
    padding: 9px 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
    color: #334155;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .eval-table tr:last-child td {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  /* Accordion for Secondary Items */
  details.exec-details {
    margin-top: 14px;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #ffffff;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  details.exec-details > summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    background: #f8fafc;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #475569;
    user-select: none;
    outline: none;
  }
  details.exec-details > summary:hover {
    background: #f1f5f9;
    color: #1e293b;
  }
  details.exec-details > .details-content {
    padding: 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
  }

  /* Filter list */
  .filter-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 11.5px;
  }
  .filter-table th {
    background: #f8fafc;
    color: #64748b;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .filter-table td {
    padding: 7px 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
    color: #475569;
  }
  .filter-table tr:last-child td {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  /* Empty states */
  .empty-state {
    padding: 24px;
    text-align: center;
    background: #f8fafc;
    border: 1px dashed #cbd5e1;
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: #64748b;
    font-size: 12.5px;
  }

  /* ========== FOOTER ========== */
  .footer {
    padding: 16px 8px;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #94a3b8;
    line-height: 1.7;
    text-align: justify;
  }
  .footer p {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .footer-divider {
    border-top: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
    margin: 12px 0;
  }

  /* ========== RESPONSIVE ========== */
  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    body { padding: 12px 6px; }
    .card, .header-card { padding: 18px 16px; }
    .header-title { font-size: 19px; }
    .dossier-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .dossier-strip { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
    .dossier-header { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
    .macro-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .table-exec { min-width: 520px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  <!-- ============================== EXECUTIVE HEADER ============================== -->
  <div class="header-card">
    <div class="header-meta">
      <span>Borsa Istanbul Model Portfoy &amp; Tarama Raporu</span>
      <span>{{ as_of_date }}</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="header-title">BIST Strateji ve Model Portfoy Bulteni</h1>
    <div class="header-subtitle">
      {% if no_action_today %}
        Hard-filter kriterlerini gecen aday bulunmamaktadir; risk yonetimi prensipleri uyarinca nakit pozisyonu korunmaktadir.
      {% elif regime_taxonomy_tag %}
        Piyasa Rejimi: <b style="color:#ffffff;">{{ regime_taxonomy_tag }}</b>. Cok faktorlu degerleme ve risk modelleri cercevesinde one cikan firsatlar asagida ozetlenmistir.
      {% else %}
        Cok faktorlu degerleme ve risk modelleri cercevesinde one cikan firsatlar asagida ozetlenmistir.
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    {% if regime %}
    <div class="macro-grid">
      <div class="macro-item">
        <span class="macro-lbl">BIST 100</span>
        <span class="macro-val">{{ regime.xu100_level | fmt }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="macro-item">
        <span class="macro-lbl">Politika Faizi</span>
        <span class="macro-val">%{{ regime.policy_rate_pct | fmt }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="macro-item">
        <span class="macro-lbl">2Y Gosterge</span>
        <span class="macro-val">%{{ regime.bond_2y_pct | fmt }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="macro-item">
        <span class="macro-lbl">Yillik TUFE</span>
        <span class="macro-val">%{{ regime.cpi_yoy_pct | fmt }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="macro-item">
        <span class="macro-lbl">USD/TRY</span>
        <span class="macro-val">{{ regime.usdtry_spot | fmt }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% if regime.short_selling_ban_active %}
    <div style="margin-top:8px;">
      <span class="macro-pill-alert">Aciga Satis Yasagi Aktif</span>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  <!-- ============================== BOZULAN TEZLER UYARISI ============================== -->
  {% if invalidation_triggered %}
  <div class="alert-card">
    <b>Bozulan Tez Bildirimi:</b> Asagidaki hisselerde onceden belirlenmis tez bozulma kosullari tetiklenmistir (Dogrudan satis sinyali degildir, model risk kontroludur):
    <ul>
      {% for t in invalidation_triggered %}
      <li><b>{{ t.ticker }}</b>: {{ t.condition_field }} {{ t.condition_operator }} {{ t.condition_value }} gerceklesti (Guncel deger: {{ t.current_value }})</li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ============================== 1. UZUN VADELI FIRSATLAR ============================== -->
  <div class="card">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2 class="section-title">1. Uzun Vadeli Firsatlar (60 – 180 Gun)</h2>
      <div class="section-desc">Sektorel goreli degerleme, Piotroski kalite filtresi ve Degerleme Ucgeni modellerine dayali stratejik pozisyonlar.</div>
    </div>

    {% if long_term_candidates %}
    <div class="table-responsive">
      <table class="table-exec">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Hisse</th>
            <th class="col-num">Kademeli Alis Bandi</th>
            <th class="col-num">Hedef Fiyat</th>
            <th class="col-roi">Beklenen Getiri</th>
            <th class="col-stop">Stop-Loss</th>
            <th class="col-range">Adil Deger (Ucgen / DCF)</th>
            <th class="col-num">Onerilen Poz.</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for c in long_term_candidates %}
          <tr>
            <td>
              <div class="col-ticker-wrap">
                <span class="col-ticker">{{ c.ticker }}</span>
                <span class="badge badge-{{ c.candidate_state }}">{{ c.candidate_state }}</span>
              </div>
            </td>
            <td class="col-num">
              {% if c.entry_low is not none and c.entry_high is not none %}
                {{ c.entry_low | fmt }} – {{ c.entry_high | fmt }}
              {% else %}
                {{ c.current_price | fmt }}
              {% endif %}
              <span class="col-sub">Guncel: {{ c.current_price | fmt }}</span>
            </td>
            <td class="col-num" style="font-weight:700; color:#0f172a;">{{ c.target_price | fmt }}</td>
            <td class="col-roi">+%{{ c.expected_roi_pct | fmt }}</td>
            <td class="col-stop">{{ c.stop_loss | fmt }}</td>
            <td class="col-range">
              {% if c.fair_value_low is not none and c.fair_value_high is not none %}
                {{ c.fair_value_low | fmt }} – {{ c.fair_value_high | fmt }}
              {% elif c.dcf and c.dcf.fair_value_low is not none and not c.dcf.null_reason %}
                {{ c.dcf.fair_value_low | fmt }} – {{ c.dcf.fair_value_high | fmt }}
              {% elif c.gordon and c.gordon.fair_value_low is not none and not c.gordon.null_reason %}
                {{ c.gordon.fair_value_low | fmt }} – {{ c.gordon.fair_value_high | fmt }}
              {% else %}
                —
              {% endif %}
            </td>
            <td class="col-num" style="font-weight:700;">
              {% if c.position_size_pct is not none %}
                %{{ c.position_size_pct | fmt }}
              {% else %}
                —
              {% endif %}
            </td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <!-- Hizli Kopyala / WhatsApp Metni -->
    <div class="quick-copy-wrapper">
      <div class="quick-copy-header">
        <span class="quick-copy-title">Yonetici Hizli Kopyala (WhatsApp / Notlar)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="quick-copy-box">{% for c in long_term_candidates %}* {{ c.ticker }} | Alis: {{ c.current_price | fmt }}{% if c.entry_low is not none and c.entry_high is not none %} (Bant: {{ c.entry_low | fmt }} - {{ c.entry_high | fmt }}){% endif %} -> Hedef: {{ c.target_price | fmt }} (%{{ c.expected_roi_pct | fmt }}){% if c.stop_loss is not none %} | Stop: {{ c.stop_loss | fmt }}{% endif %}{% if c.position_size_pct is not none %} | Poz: %{{ c.position_size_pct | fmt }}{% endif %}{% if c.fair_value_low is not none and c.fair_value_high is not none %} | Adil Deger: {{ c.fair_value_low | fmt }} - {{ c.fair_value_high | fmt }}{% elif c.dcf and c.dcf.fair_value_low is not none and not c.dcf.null_reason %} | DCF: {{ c.dcf.fair_value_low | fmt }} - {{ c.dcf.fair_value_high | fmt }}{% endif %}{{ '\n' }}{% endfor %}</div>
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <div class="empty-state">Bugun icin uzun vadeli model portfoy adayi bulunmamaktadir.</div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  <!-- ============================== 2. KISA VADELI FIRSATLAR ============================== -->
  <div class="card">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2 class="section-title">2. Kisa Vadeli Firsatlar (5 – 20 Gun)</h2>
      <div class="section-desc">20 gunluk hareketli ortalamaya geri cekilme, ATR volatilite kanali ve hacim teyitli taktiksel pozisyonlar.</div>
    </div>

    {% if short_term_candidates %}
    <div class="table-responsive">
      <table class="table-exec">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Hisse</th>
            <th class="col-num">Giris (Pullback)</th>
            <th class="col-num">ATR Hedefi</th>
            <th class="col-roi">Beklenen Getiri</th>
            <th class="col-stop">Stop-Loss</th>
            <th class="col-num">Hacim Teyidi</th>
            <th class="col-num">Onerilen Poz.</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for c in short_term_candidates %}
          <tr>
            <td>
              <div class="col-ticker-wrap">
                <span class="col-ticker">{{ c.ticker }}</span>
                <span class="badge badge-{{ c.candidate_state }}">{{ c.candidate_state }}</span>
              </div>
            </td>
            <td class="col-num">
              {{ c.entry_price | fmt }}
              {% if c.entry_low is not none and c.entry_high is not none %}
                <span class="col-sub">Bant: {{ c.entry_low | fmt }} – {{ c.entry_high | fmt }}</span>
              {% else %}
                <span class="col-sub">Guncel: {{ c.current_price | fmt }}</span>
              {% endif %}
            </td>
            <td class="col-num" style="font-weight:700; color:#0f172a;">{{ c.target_price | fmt }}</td>
            <td class="col-roi">+%{{ c.expected_roi_pct | fmt }}</td>
            <td class="col-stop">{{ c.stop_loss | fmt }}</td>
            <td class="col-num">
              {% if c.volume_ratio_20d is not none %}
                {{ c.volume_ratio_20d | fmt }}x
              {% else %}
                —
              {% endif %}
            </td>
            <td class="col-num" style="font-weight:700;">
              {% if c.position_size_pct is not none %}
                %{{ c.position_size_pct | fmt }}
              {% else %}
                —
              {% endif %}
            </td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <!-- Hizli Kopyala / WhatsApp Metni -->
    <div class="quick-copy-wrapper">
      <div class="quick-copy-header">
        <span class="quick-copy-title">Yonetici Hizli Kopyala (WhatsApp / Notlar)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="quick-copy-box">{% for c in short_term_candidates %}* {{ c.ticker }} | Giris: {{ c.entry_price | fmt }}{% if c.entry_low is not none and c.entry_high is not none %} (Bant: {{ c.entry_low | fmt }} - {{ c.entry_high | fmt }}){% endif %} -> Hedef: {{ c.target_price | fmt }} (%{{ c.expected_roi_pct | fmt }}){% if c.stop_loss is not none %} | Stop: {{ c.stop_loss | fmt }}{% endif %}{% if c.position_size_pct is not none %} | Poz: %{{ c.position_size_pct | fmt }}{% endif %}{% if c.volume_ratio_20d is not none %} | Hacim: {{ c.volume_ratio_20d | fmt }}x{% endif %}{{ '\n' }}{% endfor %}</div>
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <div class="empty-state">Bugun icin kisa vadeli taktiksel aday bulunmamaktadir.</div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  <!-- ============================== 3. ADAY BAZLI YATIRIM TEZLERI ============================== -->
  {% if long_term_candidates %}
  <div class="card">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2 class="section-title">3. Aday Bazli Yatirim Tezleri &amp; Risk Analizi</h2>
      <div class="section-desc">Her aday icin model gerekceleri, katalizorler, ana riskler ve bozulma kosullari.</div>
    </div>

    {% for c in long_term_candidates %}
    <div class="dossier-card">
      <div class="dossier-header">
        <div class="dossier-header-left">
          <span class="dossier-ticker">{{ c.ticker }}</span>
          <span class="badge badge-{{ c.candidate_state }}">{{ c.candidate_state }}</span>
          <span class="dossier-peer">{{ c.peer_group_used }} (n={{ c.peer_n }}) &middot; Guven: {{ c.confidence }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="dossier-strip">
          <span class="dossier-strip-item">Alis: <b>{{ c.current_price | fmt }}</b></span>
          <span class="dossier-strip-item">Hedef: <b style="color:#059669;">{{ c.target_price | fmt }} (+%{{ c.expected_roi_pct | fmt }})</b></span>
          {% if c.stop_loss is not none %}
          <span class="dossier-strip-item">Stop: <b style="color:#dc2626;">{{ c.stop_loss | fmt }}</b></span>
          {% endif %}
          {% if c.position_size_pct is not none %}
          <span class="dossier-strip-item">Poz: <b>%{{ c.position_size_pct | fmt }}</b></span>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="dossier-body">
        <div class="dossier-grid">
          <!-- Yatirim Tezi -->
          <div class="dossier-callout-thesis">
            <b>Yatirim Tezi &amp; Neden Simdi:</b> {{ c.why_now }}
            <ul>
              {% for b in c.thesis_bullets %}
              <li>{{ b }}</li>
              {% endfor %}
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Risk & Bozulma Sartlari -->
          <div class="dossier-callout-risk">
            <b>Ana Risk:</b> {{ c.main_risk }}
            <div class="dossier-invalidation">
              <b>Tez Bozulma Kosulu:</b> {{ c.invalidation_condition_display }}
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Finansal & Model Parametreleri -->
        <div class="metrics-grid">
          <div class="metric-entry">
            <span class="metric-key">Hurdle Orani</span>
            <span class="metric-val">%{{ c.hurdle_rate_pct | fmt }}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-entry">
            <span class="metric-key">Hurdle Uzeri Fazla</span>
            <span class="metric-val" style="color:#059669;">+%{{ c.excess_over_hurdle_pct | fmt }}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-entry">
            <span class="metric-key">Beta-Duzeltmeli Fazla</span>
            <span class="metric-val">+%{{ c.excess_over_beta_hurdle_pct | fmt }}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-entry">
            <span class="metric-key">Piotroski F-Score</span>
            <span class="metric-val">{{ c.piotroski_normalized_score | fmt }}</span>
          </div>
          {% if c.fair_value_base is not none %}
          <div class="metric-entry">
            <span class="metric-key">Adil Deger Bandi (Ucgen)</span>
            <span class="metric-val">{{ c.fair_value_low | fmt }} – {{ c.fair_value_high | fmt }}</span>
          </div>
          {% endif %}
          {% if c.valuation_method %}
          <div class="metric-entry">
            <span class="metric-key">Degerleme Metodu</span>
            <span class="metric-val">{{ c.valuation_method }}</span>
          </div>
          {% endif %}
          {% if c.net_expected_roi_pct is not none %}
          <div class="metric-entry">
            <span class="metric-key">Net Getiri (Maliyet Sonrasi)</span>
            <span class="metric-val" style="color:#059669;">+%{{ c.net_expected_roi_pct | fmt }}</span>
          </div>
          {% endif %}
          {% if c.retail_pct is not none %}
          <div class="metric-entry">
            <span class="metric-key">Perakende Payi</span>
            <span class="metric-val">%{{ c.retail_pct | fmt }}</span>
          </div>
          {% endif %}
          {% if c.momentum_score is not none %}
          <div class="metric-entry">
            <span class="metric-key">Momentum Skoru (12-1 Ay)</span>
            <span class="metric-val">{{ c.momentum_score | fmt }}</span>
          </div>
          {% endif %}
          {% if c.amihud_illiq is not none %}
          <div class="metric-entry">
            <span class="metric-key">Amihud Likidite Riski (ILLIQ)</span>
            <span class="metric-val">{{ c.amihud_illiq | fmt }}</span>
          </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>

        {% if c.upcoming_events %}
        <div class="dossier-note">
          <b>Yaklasan Kurumsal Olaylar:</b>
          {% for ev in c.upcoming_events %}{{ ev.event_type }} ({{ ev.event_date }}){% if not loop.last %}; {% endif %}{% endfor %}
        </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if c.sloan_flag %}
        <div class="warn-card" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <b>Tahakkuk Riski (Sloan):</b> elevated_earnings_quality_risk (Peer yuzdelik dilim: {{ c.sloan_peer_percentile | fmt }})
        </div>
        {% endif %}

        <!-- Referans Modeller (DCF & Gordon) -->
        {% if c.dcf and not c.dcf.null_reason %}
        <div class="ref-box">
          <b>DCF Referansi (Deneysel):</b> Adil Deger {{ c.dcf.fair_value_low | fmt }} – {{ c.dcf.fair_value_high | fmt }} &middot; WACC: %{{ c.dcf.wacc_pct | fmt }} &middot; Terminal Buyume: %{{ c.dcf.terminal_growth_pct | fmt }}
        </div>
        {% elif c.gordon and not c.gordon.null_reason %}
        <div class="ref-box">
          <b>Gordon Buyume Referansi (Deneysel):</b> Adil Deger {{ c.gordon.fair_value_low | fmt }} – {{ c.gordon.fair_value_high | fmt }}
        </div>
        {% endif %}

      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ============================== 4. PORTFOY & MAKRO DEGISIMLER ============================== -->
  {% if decision_diff.entered or decision_diff.exited or decision_diff.catalyst_deltas or decision_diff.macro_deltas or concentration_warnings %}
  <div class="card">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2 class="section-title">4. Portfoy ve Makro Degisimler</h2>
      <div class="section-desc">Onceki kosuya gore listeye yeni giren/cikan hisseler, makro guncellemeler ve yogunlasma uyarilari.</div>
    </div>

    <div style="font-size:12.5px; color:#334155; line-height:1.6;">
      {% if decision_diff.entered %}
      <div style="margin-bottom:6px;"><b>Portfoye Yeni Giren:</b> {{ decision_diff.entered | join(', ') }}</div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if decision_diff.exited %}
      <div style="margin-bottom:6px;"><b>Portfoyden Cikan:</b> {{ decision_diff.exited | join(', ') }}</div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if decision_diff.catalyst_deltas %}
      <div style="margin-top:10px;"><b>Yeni KAP Bildirimleri:</b><br>
        {% for e in decision_diff.catalyst_deltas %}&bull; {{ e.ticker }} ({{ e.category }} : {{ e.published_at }}){% if not loop.last %}<br>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if decision_diff.macro_deltas %}
      <div style="margin-top:10px;"><b>Makro Gosterge Degisimleri:</b>
        {% for m in decision_diff.macro_deltas %}{{ m.field }}: {{ m.from | fmt }} &rarr; {{ m.to | fmt }}{% if not loop.last %}; {% endif %}{% endfor %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if concentration_warnings %}
      <div class="warn-card">
        <b>Sektor / Grup Yogunlasma Uyarilari:</b>
        <ul>
          {% for w in concentration_warnings %}<li>{{ w.message }}</li>{% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ============================== HRP PORTFOY DAGILIMI & RISK ============================== -->
  {% if portfolio_result and portfolio_result.recommended_portfolio_weights %}
  <div class="card">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2 class="section-title">Hiyerarsik Risk Paritesi (HRP) Model Portfoy Agirliklari</h2>
      <div class="section-desc">Kovaryans matrisinin agac kumelemesi (López de Prado) ve sektor tavan kisiti (%30) ile optimize edilmis dengeli risk dagilimi. Model Portfoy Beklenen Getirisi: +%{{ portfolio_result.portfolio_expected_return_pct | fmt }}, Yillik Volatilite: %{{ portfolio_result.portfolio_volatility_pct | fmt }}, Beklenen Kuyruk Riski (%95 CVaR): %{{ portfolio_result.cvar_95_pct | fmt }}.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="table-responsive">
      <table class="table-exec">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Hisse</th>
            <th class="col-num">Onerilen Portfoy Agirligi</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for ticker, w in portfolio_result.recommended_portfolio_weights.items() %}
          <tr>
            <td style="font-weight:700; color:#0f172a;">{{ ticker }}</td>
            <td class="col-num" style="font-weight:700; color:#059669;">%{{ w | fmt }}</td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ============================== 5. MODEL TAHMIN IZLEME ============================== -->
  {% if evaluation_summary %}
  <div class="card">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2 class="section-title">5. Model Tahmin Izleme Ozeti</h2>
      <div class="section-desc">Canli takip ozetidir. {{ evaluation_summary.independence_caveat }}</div>
    </div>

    <table class="eval-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Ufuk (Gun)</th>
          <th>Gozlem Sayisi</th>
          <th>Isabet Orani</th>
          <th>Medyan Fazla Getiri</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for horizon, s in evaluation_summary.by_horizon.items() %}
        {% if s %}
        <tr>
          <td>{{ horizon }}</td>
          <td>{{ s.n_observations | fmt }}</td>
          <td style="font-weight:700; color:#0f172a;">%{{ s.hit_rate_pct | fmt }}</td>
          <td>%{{ s.median_excess_vs_index | fmt }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ============================== 6. KAPSAM DISI & FILTRE ============================== -->
  <div class="card">
    <details class="exec-details">
      <summary>Filtreye Takilan / Kapsam Disi Hisseler ({{ no_action_count | fmt }} Uygun Olmayan + {{ unscored_count | fmt }} Skorlanamayan)</summary>
      <div class="details-content">
        <div style="font-size:11.5px; color:#64748b; margin-bottom:10px;">
          {{ unscored_count }} adet hisse eksik veri, baz belirsizligi veya yetersiz esler grubu nedeniyle skorlanamamistir.
        </div>
        {% if filtered_candidates %}
        <table class="filter-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Hisse</th>
              <th>Filtrelenme Gerekcesi</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {% for c in filtered_candidates %}
            <tr>
              <td style="font-weight:700; color:#0f172a;">{{ c.ticker }}</td>
              <td>{{ c.filtered_by }}</td>
            </tr>
            {% endfor %}
          </tbody>
        </table>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>

  <!-- ============================== FOOTER & DISCLAIMERS ============================== -->
  <div class="footer">
    <p><b>final_score</b> = {{ weights.valuation_z | fmt }} &times; valuation_z + {{ weights.catalyst_score | fmt }} &times; catalyst_score + {{ weights.ownership_quality_z | fmt }} &times; ownership_quality_z + {{ weights.low_vol_z | fmt }} &times; low_vol_z. Piotroski esigi: {{ weights.piotroski_normalized_score_threshold | fmt }}, ERP: %{{ weights.equity_risk_premium_pct | fmt }}. Bu agirliklar ve esikler DENENMEMIS BASLANGIC VARSAYIMLARIDIR; hicbir gecmis veriyle kalibre edilmemistir.</p>
    {% if weights.dcf_growth_low_pct is defined and weights.dcf_growth_low_pct is not none %}
    <p>DCF Referansi (deneysel, ana karara girmez) buyume senaryolari: dusuk %{{ weights.dcf_growth_low_pct | fmt }} / baz %{{ weights.dcf_growth_base_pct | fmt }} / yuksek %{{ weights.dcf_growth_high_pct | fmt }}, kurumlar vergisi orani %{{ weights.dcf_corporate_tax_rate_pct | fmt }}. Buyume senaryolari DENENMEMIS VARSAYIMDIR; kurumlar vergisi orani resmi/yasal orandir.</p>
    {% endif %}
    <div class="footer-divider"></div>
    <p>{{ known_limitations_text }}</p>
    <p>{{ disclaimer_text }}</p>
  </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
